            <sourceDesc>
                <p>Framework can be seen cut into the cliff face. However, most of the characters
                    are not readable. Probably the engraving may have never been completed.</p>
                <p>There are two rubbings of this inscription. The rubbing chosen is better than the
                    one printed in Lai Fei’s book since the character 外 (second last character of
                    the second column) is more clearly shown in that rubbing.</p>
